    {
      "file": "manifests/domain_readiness.md",
      "old": "It is read only from `MLSystem 2027/implementation-1/data/domains/raw`.",
      "new": "It is read only from the raw-data directory named by the environment variable `MLSYS_RAW` (see `data/README.md`)."
