      "new": "are read only from the raw-data directory named by the environment variable `MLSYS_RAW` (see `data/README.md`)."
    },
    {
      "file": "manifests/builder_isolation.md",
      "old": "| `C:\\Users\\aashraf\\Desktop\\Work\\2026\\MLSystem 2027` | MLSys raw records and the MLSys reference code |",
      "new": "| `C:\\Users\\user\\Desktop\\Work\\2026\\EarlierProject` | raw records and reference code of an earlier project |"
